## Article 229. Recording court hearing with technical means

```catala
declaration scope Article229Recording:
  input recording content CourtRecording
  output recordingRequired content YesNo
  output videoRecordingAllowed content YesNo

scope Article229Recording:
# Audio recording is mandatory during hearings
  label audio_required definition recordingRequired under condition
    recording.allParticipantsAbsent = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label audio_not_required definition recordingRequired under condition
    recording.allParticipantsAbsent = Yes
    consequence equals No

# Video recording when court has capability and no participant objects
  label video_allowed definition videoRecordingAllowed under condition
    recording.technicalCapabilityExists = Yes
    and recording.anyParticipantObjects = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label video_not_allowed definition videoRecordingAllowed under condition
    recording.technicalCapabilityExists = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 230. Court hearing protocol

```catala
declaration scope Article230Protocol:
  input protocol content CourtProtocol
  output protocolMustBeSignedNextDay content YesNo

scope Article230Protocol:
  label sign_deadline definition protocolMustBeSignedNextDay equals Yes
```

## Article 231. Remarks on technical recording and protocol

```catala
declaration scope Article231Remarks:
  input protocol content CourtProtocol
  input remarksFiledWithinFiveDays content YesNo
  input deadlineMissed content YesNo
  output remarksCanBeConsidered content YesNo

scope Article231Remarks:
  label remarks_default definition remarksCanBeConsidered equals No

  label remarks_timely exception remarks_default
  definition remarksCanBeConsidered under condition
    remarksFiledWithinFiveDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Remarks left without consideration if deadline missed
  label remarks_untimely exception remarks_default
  definition remarksCanBeConsidered under condition
    deadlineMissed = Yes
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 232. Reproduction and copying of technical recording

```catala
declaration scope Article232RecordingAccess:
  input participantRequestsCopy content YesNo
  output copyCanBeProvided content YesNo

scope Article232RecordingAccess:
  label copy_default definition copyCanBeProvided equals No

  label copy_available exception copy_default
  definition copyCanBeProvided under condition
    participantRequestsCopy = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Articles 233-234. Protocol for separate procedural action

```catala
declaration scope Article233SeparateProtocol:
  input actionOutsideCourtroom content YesNo
  input protocolSignedByJudge content YesNo
  input protocolSignedBySecretary content YesNo
  output separateProtocolRequired content YesNo

scope Article233SeparateProtocol:
  label protocol_required definition separateProtocolRequired under condition
    actionOutsideCourtroom = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label protocol_not_required definition separateProtocolRequired under condition
    actionOutsideCourtroom = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 235. Remarks on separate action protocol

```catala
declaration scope Article235SeparateRemarks:
  input remarksFiledWithinFiveDays content YesNo
  input deadlineMissed content YesNo
  output remarksCanBeConsidered content YesNo

scope Article235SeparateRemarks:
  label remarks_default definition remarksCanBeConsidered equals No

  label remarks_timely exception remarks_default
  definition remarksCanBeConsidered under condition
    remarksFiledWithinFiveDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
